# PC card pc-team-icpt (BENCH-261): the pilot, tic on all 46 teams, 3 seeds from 29000, 12 rounds, against master (the aa build). Template: the card's prep writes the work copy with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml.
--team
true
--seeds
3
--seed-base
29000
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
